        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Maan kandiu rianra rianriu mei,",
            "Nzian mei le ntam mei ni;",
            "Kapma rianra mei guai tei ni,",
            "Tingsaeng neihla mei sudat kandiu.",
            "",
            "Rianra rianriu mei nai lakhe,",
            "Kalloumeipu bam puiram khou;",
            "Kandih rianra mei khaeng lak khe,",
            "He abumaeng neihlana tat ro!",
            "",
            "2. Ai rui ningbam e guang dat khang,",
            "Kagan lev tingmik na guang the,",
            "Kandih puat guai hei bai ngam the.",
            "Nzuan no pou rui zianlou puiram.",
            "",
            "3. Champan thiu le lungh neihla na,",
            "Zion poubaomei ta thuan no",
            "Nkhuai mei guaita kanlou na,",
            "Zaigut louni he tingkau ram khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
